Procedure Register (PR).\nReturn address saved by BSR/BSRF/JSR; RTS jumps to whatever is stored here. The closest thing the SH-2 has to a hardware link register.|过程寄存器 (PR)。\n由 BSR/BSRF/JSR 保存的返回地址；RTS 会跳转到此处存储的地址。这是 SH-2 上最接近硬件链接寄存器的东西。
Program Counter (PC).\nAddress of the instruction about to execute (delay slots are already accounted for). This is what a code breakpoint compares against.|程序计数器 (PC)。\n即将执行的指令地址 (已考虑延迟槽)。代码断点就是与它进行比较。
