This layer isn't producing any output right now.\nMost likely its BGON enable bit is off -- see the\nRegisters tab (BGON) or the main VDP2 Debug window.|此图层当前没有任何输出。\n很可能其 BGON 启用位处于关闭状态 -- 请查看\n“寄存器”标签页 (BGON) 或 VDP2 调试主窗口。
