Vector Base Register (VBR).\nBase address of the exception/interrupt vector table: vector n is the 32-bit handler address stored at VBR + n*4. Normally set once by the boot ROM/BIOS and left alone by game code.|向量基址寄存器 (VBR)。\n异常/中断向量表的基址: 向量 n 是存储在 VBR + n*4 处的 32 位处理程序地址。通常由启动 ROM/BIOS 设置一次，游戏代码不会更改。
